{"id":"app-chat","type":"text","x":5976,"y":5600,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Chat**\nPush-to-talk voice assistant. On the 1.43-B…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). Carries SCR_KEEPAWAKE.\n\n`STUB` · ⚠ [[Gaps|3 gaps]]\n[[Chat|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"1"}
],
